000200 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000300 PROGRAM-ID.           TMOVERPT.
000400 AUTHOR.               MK MADDEN.
000500 DATE-WRITTEN.         JULY 23, 1985.
000600*INSTALLATION.         GOODYEAR TIRE AND RUBBER CO.
000700*
000800*REMARKS.              THIS PROGRAM WILL READ THROUGH THE
000900*                      MATERIAL ACCUM DATA SET AND COMPUTE
001000*                      A NEW BEGINNING BALANCE FOR EACH CLASS.
001100*                      A PARAMETER WILL BE PASSED TO INDICATE
001200*                      WHETHER THIS IS THE MONTH END CLOSING
001300*                      REPORT OR NOT.  IF THIS IS THE MONTH
001400*                      END CLOSING THEN ALL MATERIAL CODE
001500*                      BALANCES WILL BE UPDATED WITH THE NEW
001600*                      BEGINNING BALANCES AND ISSUE UNITS, RETURN
001700*                      UNITS, ADJUSTMENT UNITS AND RETURN
001800*                      DOLLARS WILL BE SET TO 0.  ANY UNIT
001900*                      OR DOLLAR CORRECTIONS MADE WILL ALSO
002000*                      BE SET TO 0.
      *C
      *C   15FEB1994    DAVE PLUM
      *C     ADDED CALL TO THE COBOL ERROR HANDLER - MCXCBLERR.
      *C
      *C   SEPT 03, 1996   CA YODER
      *C     RE-COMPILED TO PICK UP CENTURY DATABASE CHANGES.

002200 ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
002300 CONFIGURATION SECTION.
002400 SOURCE-COMPUTER.      HP-3000.
