054900         MOVE SORT-CLASS          TO PREV-CLASS
055000         PERFORM 721-READ-CLASS-EXT
055100     ELSE
055200         IF CLASS-NO-EXT < SORT-CLASS
055300             IF NO-MORE-CLASS = "YES"
