055500                 MOVE "INVALID CLASS" TO PRT-CLASS-DESCR
055600                 MOVE 0           TO CLASS-DCHG-DOLLARS,
055700                                     CLASS-ONDOCK-CARRY-DOLLARS
055800             ELSE
055900                 MOVE CLASS-NO-EXT TO PRT-CLASS
056000                 MOVE CLASS-DESCR-EXT TO PRT-CLASS-DESCR
