056200                 MOVE CLASS-ONDOCK-CARRY-EXT TO
056300                       CLASS-ONDOCK-CARRY-DOLLARS
056400                 MOVE 0 TO CLASS-BEG-DOLLARS
056500                           CLASS-RCPT-DOLLARS
