057300                           CLASS-OPEN-RCVR-DOLLARS
057400                           CLASS-INTRANSIT-DOLLARS
                                 CLASS-FRAN-ISS-DOLLARS
057500                 PERFORM 721-READ-CLASS-EXT
057600         ELSE
057700             IF CLASS-NO-EXT > SORT-CLASS
057800                 IF NO-MORE-SORT = "YES"
057900                     MOVE CLASS-NO-EXT TO PRT-CLASS
058000                     MOVE CLASS-DESCR-EXT TO PRT-CLASS-DESCR
058100                     MOVE CLASS-DOLLARS-EXT TO CLASS-DCHG-DOLLARS
058200                     MOVE CLASS-ONDOCK-CARRY-EXT TO
058300                            CLASS-ONDOCK-CARRY-DOLLARS
058400                     MOVE 0 TO CLASS-BEG-DOLLARS
058500                               CLASS-RCPT-DOLLARS
058600                               CLASS-ADJ-DOLLARS-DR
058700                               CLASS-TOT-DEBITS
058800                               CLASS-ISS-DOLLARS
058900                               CLASS-ADJ-DOLLARS-CR
