066100
066200 722-PROCESS-TRANS.
066300     ADD SORT-BEG-DOLLARS         TO CLASS-BEG-DOLLARS.
066400     ADD SORT-RCPT-DOLLARS        TO CLASS-RCPT-DOLLARS.
066500     IF SORT-ADJ-DOLLARS < 0
066600         ADD SORT-ADJ-DOLLARS     TO CLASS-ADJ-DOLLARS-CR
066700     ELSE
066800         ADD SORT-ADJ-DOLLARS     TO CLASS-ADJ-DOLLARS-DR.
066900     IF SORT-DOLLAR-CORR < 0
067000         ADD SORT-DOLLAR-CORR     TO CLASS-ADJ-DOLLARS-CR
067100     ELSE
067200         ADD SORT-DOLLAR-CORR     TO CLASS-ADJ-DOLLARS-DR.
067300     COMPUTE CLASS-ISS-DOLLARS  = CLASS-ISS-DOLLARS +
067400                     (SORT-ISS-DOLLARS - SORT-RTN-DOLLARS -
067500                           SORT-RTNVAL-DOLLARS).
067600     ADD SORT-INV-ONDOCK-DOLLARS  TO CLASS-INV-DLRS-ONDOCK.
067700     ADD SORT-OPEN-RCVR-DOLLARS   TO CLASS-OPEN-RCVR-DOLLARS.
