072900     WRITE PRT-REC FROM DETAIL-LINE2 AFTER ADVANCING 2 LINES.
073000     WRITE PRT-REC FROM DETAIL-LINE3 AFTER ADVANCING 1 LINES.
073100     ADD 5                        TO LINE-CNT.
073200     IF LINE-CNT > 55
073300         PERFORM  750-PRINT-HEADINGS.
073400
