075700                                     CLASS-RCPT-DOLLARS
075800                                     CLASS-DCHG-DOLLARS
075900                                     CLASS-ADJ-DOLLARS-DR
076000                                     CLASS-OPEN-RCVR-DOLLARS
076100                                     CLASS-TOT-DEBITS
076200                                     CLASS-ISS-DOLLARS
076300                                     CLASS-ADJ-DOLLARS-CR
076400                                     CLASS-INV-DLRS-ONDOCK
076500                                     CLASS-ONDOCK-CARRY-DOLLARS
076600                                     CLASS-INTRANSIT-DOLLARS
076700                                     CLASS-TOT-CREDITS
076800                                     CLASS-END-DOLLARS
                                           CLASS-FRAN-ISS-DOLLARS.
076900
077000
