077700     MOVE TOT-INV-DLRS-ONDOCK     TO PRT-INV-DLRS-ONDOCK.
077800     MOVE TOT-DEBITS              TO PRT-TOT-DR.
077900     MOVE TOT-ISS-DOLLARS         TO PRT-ISSUES.
078000     MOVE TOT-ADJ-DOLLARS-CR      TO PRT-ADJ-CR.
078100     MOVE TOT-CREDITS             TO PRT-TOT-CR.
078200     MOVE TOT-END-DOLLARS         TO PRT-END-BAL.
078300     MOVE TOT-INTRANSIT-DOLLARS   TO PRT-INTRANSIT-DOLLARS.
078400     MOVE SPACES                  TO PRT-CLASS.
078500     MOVE "TOTAL"                 TO PRT-CLASS-DESCR.
078600     MOVE TOT-ONDOCK              TO PRT-TOTAL-ONDOCK.
           MOVE TOT-FRAN-ISS-DOLLARS    TO PRT-FRAN-ISSUES.
078700
