081200     MOVE MACCT-YEAR              TO YEAR-PARM.
081300     MOVE MONTH-T (MONTH-PARM)    TO MONTH-H3.
081400     MOVE YEAR-PARM               TO YEAR-H3B.
081500     ADD 1                        TO PAGE-CNT.
081600     MOVE PAGE-CNT                TO PAGE-H2.
081700     WRITE PRT-REC FROM HEADER1 AFTER ADVANCING NEW-PAGE.
